  "currentAttributionFullPreparation": "Fresh prepared packet has 104 verified members, five finite Rust test executions and fourteen host controls. Original tiny harness executes ten synthetic guest instructions total; no real target validation or invocation. Owned preparation scratch removed, exact binary retained compressed. Independent review found supplementary classifier schema/type validation weakness; correction pending and no full attempt selected. See docs/swift-current-attribution-full-preparation.md.",
  "identityObserverDelivery": "Coherent checkpoint 7b6048642b42e4900cccff4e14aa0fe8949ab35e is pushed and remote main verified. Exactly 638 changed paths; active generic-build and preparation-review lanes excluded. Phoenix CI 40179798794 passes its job and all eight steps without skips; Engine CI 40179798720 passes all three jobs and all 38 steps without skips. See verification/github-ci-7b604864/receipt.json. See verification/github-delivery-identity-observers/receipt.json. No new native or GA acceptance.",
  "currentAttributionPreparationReview": "Independent review identified six malformed supplementary schema cases; a strict-schema correction is now root accepted after 38 host methods. Original review finding remains preserved. See docs/swift-current-attribution-preparation-review.md and docs/swift-attribution-schema-correction.md.",
  "currentAttributionSchemaCorrection": "Root accepts the strict supplementary schema correction: 38 host methods pass, all six review malformed cases reject and both retained finite producer outputs retain classification. Original guest Result remains authoritative. Legacy mutation commands are disabled. The separate selected actual diagnostic has now executed once and failed the original work limit. See docs/swift-attribution-schema-correction.md and verification/current-diagnostic-corrections-root-review/swift-acceptance.json.",
  "currentAttributionRuntime": "One corrected full Swift attribution diagnostic reproduces Corpus 1 CacheWork 64,000,001/64,000,000 after 23,358,291 instructions; Corpus 2 remains unrun. All five supplementary snapshots are valid: 61,627 completed decodes, 485 distinct functions and 61,142 repeats; repeated IR construction consumes 34,500,496 credits (53.907% of budget). Original Result and legacy false cleanup flag are preserved separately from final zero consuming usage. Owned processes and scratch are removed. Root accepts the independently audited retained measurements; no optimization, full-workload or GA pass. See docs/swift-current-attribution-runtime.md.",
