  "retentionCandidate": "The isolated segmented-LRU candidate is rejected for live integration after one original-harness same-budget comparison: CacheWork exhaustion at 8,746,437 instructions versus baseline 23,358,291. Validation and Initialize pass; Corpus 1 fails and Corpus 2 is unrun. The prior 47 cache methods, seven independent finite methods and reviewed fresh preparation remain valid scoped evidence, not proof of target benefit. No limits changed, no retry selected, live VM unchanged. Original failure is retained; final consuming reservations/live/tickets are zero and 78,039,492 owned bytes removed. Independent result audit and root acceptance confirm the rejection evidence. See docs/swift-retention-runtime.md.",
