  "costRetentionRejection": "The isolated cost/age retention candidate is rejected before full-target selection: all six fixed finite traces consume more work, including a 31.717x phase-change regression. Pristine baseline 39 methods, common-added baseline 42 and candidate 49 are kept distinct; both copies pass five generic unit and ten integration methods with matching output. Independent raw-evidence audit passes; root verifies 94 retained bindings and unchanged 132-file live VM closure. Owned scratch removal reclaims 218,566,668 logical bytes. No live integration, candidate correctness acceptance or full-target run. See docs/swift-cost-retention-candidate-review.md and verification/swift-cost-retention-root-acceptance/acceptance.json.",
